<%- include('partials/head') %>
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap narrow reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1 class="display">An academy for people who want AI to <em>work for them.</em></h1>
    <p class="lead muted">Sarrawy Academy was founded on a simple belief: anyone can learn to use artificial intelligence well, if it’s taught clearly, honestly and with real practice.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap split split-top">
    <div class="reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Our mission</p>
      <h2 class="display-md">Make practical AI skills accessible.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="prose reveal">
      <p>AI is changing how people research, write, analyse and build. Most learning material either drowns beginners in theory or sells shortcuts that don’t hold up. We teach the middle path: the understanding you need to use AI with confidence, and the hands-on practice to make it part of your everyday work.</p>
      <p>Our courses are designed around projects. Every lesson leads to something you make, test and improve — because skills stick when you use them.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">What we value</p>
      <h2 class="display-md">Principles behind every lesson</h2>
    </div>
    <dl class="values">
      <div class="reveal"><dt><span class="mono">01</span> Clarity</dt><dd>If a concept can be explained simply, we explain it simply. Then we make it precise.</dd></div>
      <div class="reveal"><dt><span class="mono">02</span> Honesty</dt><dd>We show what AI does well, where it fails, and how to check its work before you rely on it.</dd></div>
      <div class="reveal"><dt><span class="mono">03</span> Practice</dt><dd>Projects over passive watching. You learn by building, testing and getting feedback.</dd></div>
      <div class="reveal"><dt><span class="mono">04</span> Responsibility</dt><dd>Privacy, fairness and security are part of the curriculum, not an afterthought.</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap cta reveal">
    <h2 class="display-md">Have a question about the academy?</h2>
    <p class="lead muted">We read every message. Write to <a href="mailto:<%= contactEmail %>"><%= contactEmail %></a> or use the contact form.</p>
    <div class="actions center"><a class="btn" href="/contact">Contact us</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
